@startuml
!pragma layout smetana
title SHA Smart Home - System architecture
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
left to right direction

actor "User" as User
component "Control panel\nControlPanelApplication" as Panel
component "Broker server\nServerApplication" as Server
component "Sensor node\nSensorNodeApplication" as Node
database "Automatic node addresses\nnode-addresses.properties" as Registry

User --> Panel : CLI commands
Panel --> Server : TLS 1.3 over TCP\nstarts connection
Node --> Server : TLS 1.3 over TCP\nstarts connection
Server --> Registry : load and save assignments

note bottom of Node
  Simulates temperature, humidity, a heater and a fan.
end note
note bottom of Server
  Registers clients, checks access and routes requests.
  Supports multiple panel and node connections.
end note
@enduml
